{"id":"0173e0f8c9568f2f","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-polynomial-string-functions.md","title":"Polynomial-Time Computable Function","display":"df-polynomial-time-computable-function — Polynomial-Time Computable Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-polynomial-string-functions","aliases":["73-df-polynomial-string-functions","73-df-polynomial-time-computable-function"],"display":"df-polynomial-time-computable-function — Polynomial-Time Computable Function","depends_on":["[[73-df-string-function-computation]]","[[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]","[[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-polynomial-string-functions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-polynomial-string-functions</span><span>73-df-polynomial-time-computable-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-polynomial-time-computable-function — Polynomial-Time Computable Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fd9e85296ed6a24d\" href=\"?note=fd9e85296ed6a24d\" title=\"73-df-string-function-computation\">73-df-string-function-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"888d8ab66ec7efca\" href=\"?note=888d8ab66ec7efca\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-semantics\">73-df-dtm-language-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"773cae915e5165f3\" href=\"?note=773cae915e5165f3\" title=\"73-df-partial-value-conventions\">73-df-partial-value-conventions</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbf 2^*\\to\\mathbf 2^*\">\\(f:\\mathbf 2^*\\to\\mathbf 2^*\\)</span> (total binary-string function)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf 2}\">\\(M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf 2}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\mathbf 2,\\mathbf 2}(M,f)\">\\(\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\mathbf 2,\\mathbf 2}(M,f)\\)</span> (function computation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fd9e85296ed6a24d\" href=\"?note=fd9e85296ed6a24d\" title=\"73-df-string-function-computation\">73-df-string-function-computation</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_M^{\\mathsf{init}}\">\\(C_M^{\\mathsf{init}}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_M\">\\(\\to_M\\)</span> (single-tape operational semantics, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"888d8ab66ec7efca\" href=\"?note=888d8ab66ec7efca\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-semantics\">73-df-dtm-language-semantics</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pmin}\">\\(\\operatorname{pmin}\\)</span> 与部分点值的定义域约定见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"773cae915e5165f3\" href=\"?note=773cae915e5165f3\" title=\"73-df-partial-value-conventions\">73-df-partial-value-conventions</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{stime}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{stime}_M\\)</span> 只在停机输入上有定义。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}time\\text{-}computable\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{stime}_M(w)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{pmin}\\{m\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\;\n\\bigl(\\rho(0)=C_M^{\\mathsf{init}}(w)\n\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\;(\\rho(i)\\to_M\\rho(i+1))\n\\land\\operatorname{Halting}_M(\\rho(m))\\bigr)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}time\\text{-}computable\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{stime}_M(w)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{pmin}\\{m\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\;\n\\bigl(\\rho(0)=C_M^{\\mathsf{init}}(w)\n\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\;(\\rho(i)\\to_M\\rho(i+1))\n\\land\\operatorname{Halting}_M(\\rho(m))\\bigr)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}time\\text{-}computable\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{FP}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{f:\\mathbf 2^*\\to\\mathbf 2^*:\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf 2}\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\mathbf 2,\\mathbf 2}(M,f)\n\\land\\exists k,c\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\\\\n\\qquad{}\\forall w\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\;\n(|w|\\geq n_0\\to\\operatorname{stime}_M(w)\\leq c|w|^k)\\bigr)\n\\end{array}\n\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}time\\text{-}computable\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{FP}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{f:\\mathbf 2^*\\to\\mathbf 2^*:\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf 2}\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\mathbf 2,\\mathbf 2}(M,f)\n\\land\\exists k,c\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\\\\n\\qquad{}\\forall w\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\;\n(|w|\\geq n_0\\to\\operatorname{stime}_M(w)\\leq c|w|^k)\\bigr)\n\\end{array}\n\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The same machine both computes the function and satisfies the polynomial bound; this closes the witness mismatch in the former use of an undeclared <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{FP}\">\\(\\mathsf{FP}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypo